      <h2 id="projectTitle">About QuizMaster Pro</h2>
      <p>QuizMaster Pro brings the main steps of an online assessment into one place. Teachers can prepare and organize questions, schedule exams for registered students, and review results. Students can sign in, complete assigned exams, and check results when they are released.</p>
